## Known limitations

- This is an interactive HTML Android design prototype, not an APK or Android source implementation.
- Native Android APIs are simulated: Photo Picker, camera, notification permission, offline process death, and OS navigation are represented behaviorally.
- No instrumentation test was run on an Android emulator/device because there is no Android Breeder implementation yet.
- Backend persistence, real account synchronization, real notifications, and real Journal integration are not implemented.
- The prototype intentionally inherits the holistic v0.2 round queue model rather than changing scheduling semantics.

## Recommended next step

Run a fresh independent Android product/design review of the exact prototype bytes. If PASS, promote this artifact only as Android Breeder design authority; Android implementation admission should be a separate bounded cycle.
